🇺🇸🇪🇺🇺🇦 Is China Deliberately Supplying Ukraine Drones?

▪️A recent FT article, likely very deliberately, depicted Europe as allocating funds to buy components for Ukrainian combat drones from China;

▪️The way this actually works is front companies around the globe buy the components and divert them to US/European operations who then transfer either kits or assembled drones to Ukraine making it difficult for China to track and stop without blanket export bans; 

▪️This is precisely how China is still accessing US-designed GPUs and cloud computing for its AI industry, by the way;

▪️But the FT, by framing it this way, seeks to create a wedge between Russia and China, if nowhere else, across social media;

▪️The US is heavily invested in creating anti-China sentiment worldwide including among China's friends and allies - which is important to keep in mind when interpreting articles like FT's.
